{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-27a","no":"EP.27A","tag":"第27話 番外 · 懲罰","title":"懲罰","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-27a:1","s":"n","t":"倉庫門開啟的清晨，離麵包店很遠的上游，水撞石激起白浪，黑虎獨自蜷著。","bg":"river","tone":"dark","bgm":"gloom2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:2","s":"n","t":"背上十二道黑手印，傷在破披風下抽痛。它沒舔，彷彿舔了就承認疼。","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"sad"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27a:3","s":"n","t":"它摸索披風內。紙裹麵包仍在，一夜後暖意盡失，只剩形狀。"},{"id":"ep-27a:4","s":"tiger","t":"您說過，涼了就只是麵包呢。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27a:5","s":"n","t":"展開旁邊紙條，歪斜寫著三個字，是祭典島打鼓、被它收走掌聲的孩子的名字。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:6","s":"tiger","t":"還打鼓嗎？即使沒有掌聲。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-27a:7","s":"n","t":"紙條無答。它折回，指尖比合賬本時小心許多。"},{"id":"ep-27a:8","s":"n","t":"沒拿麵包，只確認位置。鼓手名字的紙條與麵包，賬外之物變成兩件。"},{"id":"ep-27a:9","s":"n","t":"展開賬本，Yeoni欄寫著餘額為零，下面卻隱現從未寫過的一行。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:10","s":"sys","t":"[ 帳本 · 乙亥 Yeoni · 未收款 1 ]"},{"id":"ep-27a:11","s":"tiger","t":"未收款，是說什麼呢。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27a:12","s":"n","t":"意味著尚有未收的代價。它用爪刮那行，沒擦掉，反而更清晰。"},{"id":"ep-27a:13","s":"tiger","t":"我還有什麼沒收？那孩子連明天都交完了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27a:14","s":"n","t":"話出，額上的觸感重來：一無所剩的孩子用額頭推環，還有「疼就說疼」的聲音。"},{"id":"ep-27a:15","s":"n","t":"它取走的是運氣，可賬本說它自己收了某樣東西，某樣還沒能歸還的東西。"},{"id":"ep-27a:16","s":"n","t":"右前爪黑環發紅，一格格收緊，傳出壓骨的響聲。","im":true,"fx":"thread","sfx":"heartbeat","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"thread","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:17","s":"tiger","t":"呃啊。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27a:18","s":"n","t":"河面劃開黑裂縫，是被擠到另一片天空的間隙，聲音沿環流入。","bg":"hands","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:19","s":"heuk","t":"虎兒，抱住吾之容器的前爪，竟還留著。"},{"id":"ep-27a:20","s":"tiger","t":"還在。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:21","s":"heuk","t":"可惜，本該早些取下。"},{"id":"ep-27a:22","s":"n","t":"環又緊。它不慘叫，只把爪釘入岩石撐住，最後岩石裂了。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:23","s":"heuk","t":"為何來吾這裡，記得麼。"},{"id":"ep-27a:24","s":"tiger","t":"為在那孩子成為怪物前阻止她。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:25","s":"heuk","t":"正是。她如同背叛你一般，終將背叛所有人。"},{"id":"ep-27a:25b","s":"heuk","t":"給你阻止她機會的，是誰。"},{"id":"ep-27a:26","s":"tiger","t":"是您。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:27","s":"heuk","t":"這份恩情，妳忘了嗎？"},{"id":"ep-27a:28","s":"tiger","t":"沒有忘，一天也沒有。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:29","s":"heuk","t":"可你卻從那河裡救了她。"},{"id":"ep-27a:30","s":"n","t":"老虎無答，只有水聲。為什麼那樣做，它自己也不懂。"},{"id":"ep-27a:31","s":"n","t":"代替回答，浮起一個場景。非它所選，每逢環緊，那畫面便先漏出來。","bg":"rainStop","tone":"desat","bgm":"memWater","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:32","s":"n","t":"雨中車站的溼長椅，及某人傾過半把傘的手，臉總被雨線遮住。"},{"id":"ep-27a:33","s":"n","t":"接著是同一隻手推開它的場景，可是否真是同一隻手，總模糊不清。"},{"id":"ep-27a:34","s":"n","t":"記憶總斷在此，黑月的聲音填滿斷處。那孩子會背叛，會背叛。","sfx":"rain"},{"id":"ep-27a:35","s":"heuk","t":"問妳一件事。那個麵包，多少錢？","bg":"hands","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"sad"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-27a:36","s":"tiger","t":"什麼？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27a:37","s":"heuk","t":"你披風有氣味，賬上沒有的氣味。"},{"id":"ep-27a:38","s":"n","t":"它下意識用前爪護住披風，這動作成了回答。縫後傳來笑聲。"},{"id":"ep-27a:39","s":"heuk","t":"無物免費。那麵包的價，終要以你的血來結。"},{"id":"ep-27a:40","s":"tiger","t":"麵包由我償還。請別碰那家店。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27a:41","s":"heuk","t":"喔？是在命令我？"},{"id":"ep-27a:42","s":"tiger","t":"是在請求您。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27a:43","s":"n","t":"環最後猛緊，它向前栽倒，臉砸入河裡，冷水灌進鼻中。","im":true,"fx":"veil","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:44","s":"heuk","t":"允你所求。代價是去辦事。"},{"id":"ep-27a:45","s":"heuk","t":"那孩子今晨去了人間，貓也披著人的麵皮跟去了。"},{"id":"ep-27a:46","s":"heuk","t":"你也用人的面容去。了結之處，在那一邊。"},{"id":"ep-27a:47","s":"tiger","t":"人的面容，早就失去了。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27a:48","s":"heuk","t":"還你便是。不過是借，利息你該懂。"},{"id":"ep-27a:49","s":"n","t":"黑毛如雨流落，爪變手，利爪變指甲。環未消失，化作細金線嵌進右腕。","fx":"transform","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"transform","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:50","s":"n","t":"裂縫合上，河邊一個溼發女人跪著，手仍握賬本。"},{"id":"ep-27a:51","s":"n","t":"女人過了許久才翻披風。披風變黑大衣，內袋裝著一紙條、一面包。","bg":"river","tone":"desat","bgm":"rainWindow","shot":"quiet","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:52","s":"n","t":"拆紙後面包已涼，她仍咬一口。"},{"id":"ep-27a:53","s":"n","t":"涼麵包仍有甜和黃油香，賬上記不下的滋味，在舌尖慢慢散開。"},{"id":"ep-27a:54","s":"n","t":"女人的肩膀顫了一下。她沒有哭。只是雨水順著臉流了下來。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:55","s":"n","t":"她只吃一半，又把剩下一半包好。沒人問為什麼，問了大概也答不出。"},{"id":"ep-27a:56","s":"n","t":"雨夜，舊公寓走廊熒光燈閃著。盡頭並排兩家，其中一家門前有破角傘架。","bg":"aptHall","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"aptHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: aptHall","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"aptHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:57","s":"n","t":"隔壁空屋門前，多了一把黑傘。雨水從傘尖一滴滴落到地板上。"},{"id":"ep-27a:58","s":"n","t":"門開又關，走廊只留雨味。","sfx":"door"},{"id":"ep-27a:59","s":"n","t":"空屋地上積塵。她不點燈，站到窗前，溼外套滴答落水。","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27a:60","s":"n","t":"薄牆後有什麼落地，隨後傳來夢囈般的低語。","sfx":"thud"},{"id":"ep-27a:61","s":"n","t":"只有「襪子」一詞清楚傳來，餘下淹在雨裡，聽不出是誰。"},{"id":"ep-27a:62","s":"n","t":"她掌貼牆，右腕金線冷亮。牆後低語忽斷，像睡著的人也察覺了這邊。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"aptHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: aptHall","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"aptHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:63","s":"tiger","t":"連這裡，您也這麼吵呢。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27a:64","s":"n","t":"她收手，不脫溼衣，坐地背靠牆，等牆後聲音漸息。"},{"id":"ep-27a:65","s":"n","t":"膝上賬本，那行未收款在黑暗中微亮。她看了很久，才合攏。","im":true,"shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"aptHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: aptHall","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"aptHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
